title: OpenAI Platform: Model usage
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows provider-reported usage for a model observed in the aggregation window. These services are activity-based and may vanish when the model is no longer present in recent usage data. Optional thresholds are disabled by default. Usage documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10478918-reviewing-api-usage-and-costs.
item: Project name followed by model name.
discovery: Activity-based model services can be disabled with the OpenAI Platform project service discovery rule.  A service is discovered for each project/model combination with activity in the usage aggregation window.
